sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Customer
    participant AC as Amazon Connect
    participant AR as AgentCore Runtime bidi
    participant NS as Nova 2 Sonic
    participant SA as Supervisor Agent
    participant TL as Tool triage or knowledge

    C->>AC: Places voice call
    AC->>AR: WebSocket open plus session.start<br/>tenantId, vin, jwt
    AR->>NS: Open bidirectional audio stream
    AR->>SA: Construct BidiAgent with tool catalog

    Note over C,NS: Audio streaming phase<br/>16 kHz mono PCM, 100 ms chunks

    C->>AC: Speaks utterance
    AC->>AR: PCM chunks
    AR->>NS: PCM chunks bidi

    C-->>AC: Trailing silence
    AC-->>AR: PCM silence
    AR-->>NS: PCM silence

    rect rgb(70, 40, 90)
    Note over NS: CONSTRAINT: End-of-utterance detection<br/>requires >= 1,600 ms trailing silence.<br/>Below threshold, Nova accepts audio<br/>but emits ZERO TTS for the rest<br/>of the session.
    end

    NS->>SA: End-of-turn -- dispatch tools

    rect rgb(120, 40, 40)
    Note over SA,TL: CONSTRAINT ZONE: ~1 s tool-completion budget<br/>Nova 2 Sonic v2 platform limit<br/>not workaroundable in app code
    Note over SA,TL: Order: triage first, then routed specialists
    SA->>TL: Invoke tool
    TL-->>SA: Result
    SA-->>NS: Return tool output
    end

    Note over SA,NS: If any tool exceeds ~1 s,<br/>Nova post-tool TTS goes silent<br/>for the rest of the session,<br/>until the 55 s session timeout fires.

    NS->>NS: TTS synth 24 kHz PCM
    NS-->>AR: Audio output chunks
    AR-->>AC: Audio output chunks
    AC-->>C: Spoken response

    C->>AC: Session end caller hangs up
    AC->>AR: Close WebSocket

    Note over C,TL: ----------  Separate constraint boundary  ----------

    rect rgb(40, 60, 100)
    Note over AR,NS: CONSTRAINT: 55 s AgentCore session timeout
    Note over AR,NS: No audio bytes or interactive content between AR and NS for 55 s -> AgentCore closes session with InternalErrorCode=532.
    Note over AR,NS: Long tool chains must finish inside this window. Sessions with user think-time need keep-alive activity before 55 s.
    end
